---
// Lab 09 · One Note — disciplined restraint: dead-centred column between two hairlines, tight Inter, one chromatic note (amber) used twice on a warm-tinted near-black.
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>09 · One Note</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" />
    <style>
      :root { --bg:#0A0B0D; --surface:#141619; --border:#242830; --text:#F2F4F7; --muted:#98A0AC; --accent:#BBD9F0; }
      * { box-sizing: border-box; }
      body { margin: 0; background: var(--bg); color: var(--text); font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; }
      .tag { position: fixed; top: 1rem; left: 1rem; font: 600 11px ui-monospace, monospace; letter-spacing: .1em; padding: .35rem .6rem; border-radius: 4px; z-index: 9; background: var(--accent); color: var(--bg); }
      .hero { min-height: 100vh; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 4rem 2rem; }
      .inner { width: min(100%, 72rem); display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; text-align: center; padding: 5.5rem 2rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
      .mark { width: .625rem; height: .625rem; background: var(--accent); }
      .eyebrow { margin: 1.5rem 0 0; font-size: .8125rem; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: .2em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted); }
      h1 { font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -.045em; line-height: 1.05; font-size: clamp(2.75rem, 5.5vw, 4.75rem); margin: 2.25rem 0 0; max-width: 20ch; text-wrap: balance; }
      .sub { color: var(--muted); font-size: 1.1875rem; line-height: 1.6; margin: 1.75rem 0 0; max-width: 50ch; }
      .actions { margin-top: 3rem; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 2.5rem; }
      .btn { background: var(--accent); color: var(--bg); border-radius: 9999px; padding: .875rem 1.75rem; font-weight: 600; font-size: 1rem; text-decoration: none; }
      .link { color: var(--muted); text-decoration: none; font-size: .9375rem; }
      .link:hover { color: var(--text); }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="tag">09 · ONE NOTE</div>
    <section class="hero" data-shot="hero">
      <div class="inner">
        <span class="mark"></span>
        <p class="eyebrow">Zaid Hossain — builder for hire</p>
        <h1>You&apos;ve had the idea long enough.</h1>
        <p class="sub">I build the app, site, or automation you&apos;ve been circling for months. Scoped tight, built in the open, handed over working.</p>
        <div class="actions">
          <a class="btn" href="#">Book a 20-minute call</a>
          <a class="link" href="#">See the work ↓</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </body>
</html>
